OL,3,GNEWSABristol care home chef through to
OL,4,AUK best finals
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home chef has made it into the
OL,7,Ffinals of a UK competition with his
OL,8,F#4.50 salmon dish.
OL,10,FDarren Nelson, who works at Trymview
OL,11,FHall in Westbury-on-Trym in Bristol,
OL,12,Fhopes to be crowned Care Home Chef of
OL,13,Fthe Year at a national competition on
OL,14,F14 October in Loughborough.
OL,16,FHe said cooking for residents takes a
OL,17,Flot of skill as the dishes need to
OL,18,Fcater for varying dietary requirements,
OL,19,Fbe high in nutrition and low budget.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
